00:16:58,550 --> 00:17:01,950
adds some thinking
behind what happened,

270
00:17:01,950 --> 00:17:06,210
what led to the failure or the
success of this trajectory,

271
00:17:06,210 --> 00:17:07,869
and this apparently
has been very

272
00:17:07,869 --> 00:17:14,349
helpful in overall increasing
the quality of this approach.

273
00:17:14,349 --> 00:17:17,530
So they tested this
approach on HotPotQA,

274
00:17:17,530 --> 00:17:23,390
which is some data set that we
