306
00:19:09,650 --> 00:19:12,770
So to summarize,
what LATs proposed

307
00:19:12,770 --> 00:19:17,130
was a new technique for
bringing in reasoning,

308
00:19:17,130 --> 00:19:19,590
taking actions and
planning all together,

309
00:19:19,590 --> 00:19:23,490
and brought in our
known ideas like MCTS

310
00:19:23,490 --> 00:19:27,330
into the language model world.

311
00:19:27,330 --> 00:19:31,530
And they got very strong
results on multiple domains.

312
00:19:31,530 --> 00:19:35,290
And given their
test time approach

313
00:19:35,290 --> 00:19:38,010
