382
00:23:29,270 --> 00:23:32,130
So let's now talk about SPRINT.

383
00:23:32,130 --> 00:23:36,750
This is a NeurIPS 2025 paper, so
this hasn't been even presented

384
00:23:36,750 --> 00:23:39,510
