853
00:51:00,070 --> 00:51:03,150
So motivation, again,
many real world tasks

854
00:51:03,150 --> 00:51:05,810
require multi-step
reasoning and tool use.

855
00:51:05,810 --> 00:51:09,870
For example, if you want to
