862
00:51:31,350 --> 00:51:35,140
use in order to solve a problem.

863
00:51:35,140 --> 00:51:38,540
So the challenges, again, in
multi-step reasoning and tool

864
00:51:38,540 --> 00:51:45,720
use setting is that then you're
doing reasoning and tool use.

865
00:51:45,720 --> 00:51:48,440
Even for one step, it
